# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID for Bookata.
#
# Without it the site loads no analytics script at all, and the "Ver precio"
# affiliate clicks (the `click_amazon` event in AmazonButton) are not recorded
# anywhere.
#
# The production id (G-DBKB5VF49W) is committed in src/app/layout.tsx, because a
# measurement id is public by design and an unset variable silently means no
# analytics at all. Set this variable only to point a build at a different
# property, for example a staging one.
#
# Format: G-XXXXXXXXXX. Create the property at analytics.google.com, in
# Admin > Data streams > Web, for the domain bookata.es.
#
# Bookata must have its OWN property. Do not reuse the ValuePerFan ID.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=
